  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Go 语言的 Protocol Buffers 完整实现，由 Google 维护。包含两大组件：protoc-gen-go（protoc 编译器插件，将 .proto 文件编译生成 Go 代码）与 protobuf 运行时库（提供消息序列化/反序列化、JSON/文本/二进制 wire 格式编解码、反射操作等核心能力）。是 google.golang.org/protobuf 模块的第二版 Go protobuf API，替代旧版 github.com/golang/protobuf。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "Protocol Buffers 代码生成",
        "description": "protoc-gen-go 插件将 .proto 定义编译为 Go 结构体与方法，支持 open/hybrid/opaque 三种生成模式，含 editions 支持与向后兼容的旧版 API 包装",
        "evidence": [
          "cmd/protoc-gen-go/main.go",
          "compiler/protogen/protogen.go",
          "cmd/protoc-gen-go/internal_gengo/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "二进制 wire 格式编解码",
        "description": "Protocol Buffers 二进制 wire format 的序列化与反序列化，含 varint/定长/长度前缀三种字段编码、messageset 格式、延迟解码等优化路径",
        "evidence": [
          "proto/encode.go",
          "proto/decode.go",
          "encoding/protowire/wire.go",
          "internal/impl/codec_field.go"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "JSON 格式编解码",
        "description": "protobuf 消息与 JSON 的双向转换，遵循 proto3 JSON mapping 规范，含 Well-Known Types 的特殊处理（Timestamp/Duration/Struct 等）",
        "evidence": [
          "encoding/protojson/encode.go",
          "encoding/protojson/decode.go",
          "encoding/protojson/well_known_types.go"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "文本格式编解码",
        "description": "protobuf 文本格式（text format）的序列化与反序列化，用于调试与配置场景",
        "evidence": [
          "encoding/prototext/encode.go",
          "encoding/prototext/decode.go"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "运行时反射与动态消息",
        "description": "提供 protobuf 消息的反射接口（protoreflect）、注册表（protoregistry）、动态消息构造（dynamicpb）与描述符协议转换（protodesc），支持运行时检查消息结构与值",
        "evidence": [
          "reflect/protoreflect/proto.go",
          "reflect/protoregistry/registry.go",
          "types/dynamicpb/dynamic.go",
          "reflect/protodesc/desc.go"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "消息操作与工具",
        "description": "protobuf 消息的克隆、合并、相等比较、重置、大小计算、可选字段校验等通用操作，以及路径遍历（protopath）、范围遍历（protorange）等辅助工具",
        "evidence": [
          "proto/clone.go",
          "proto/merge.go",
          "proto/equal.go",
          "proto/reset.go",
          "proto/size.go",
          "reflect/protopath/path.go",
          "reflect/protorange/range.go"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "数据序列化",
    "target_users": "Go 语言应用开发者与微服务开发者"
  },
